己在怪别人，不太应该。<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690444383001688,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":4,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af67608f4429d1fd72f778c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536968392,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":{"emotion":{"type":"悲观","keywords":["难受","堵得慌","烦自己","别扭","笨"],"originalText":["心里就堵得慌","就是……烦自己吧","可我总觉得像在给自己找借口","越想越觉得自己笨"]},"conversation":{"type":"自我认知与成长","topic":"来访者因丢失眼霜触发强烈自责，探讨其完美主义倾向、家庭规则内化及自我苛责模式"}},"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67602f4429d1fd72f7784","chatId":"abca853f5a66411a852ca3f67af6eb8d","sessionId":null,"userId":99847,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“先别让她知道”——这句话里藏着的，是小时候那种怕被说的紧张。东西丢了，你第一反应不是心疼，而是想着怎么瞒住。这份紧张到现在还跟着你。现在弄丢眼霜，心里冒出来的，还是那个怕被谁发现的声音吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“先别让她知道”——这句话里藏着的，是小时候那种怕被说的紧张。东西丢了，你第一反应不是心疼，而是想着怎么瞒住。这份紧张到现在还跟着你。现在弄丢眼霜，心里冒出来的，还是那个怕被谁发现的声音吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evalu